        "original_id": "8bce3687-77a6-5bd2-8a19-1b32fae888f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Verse Simmonds, Rihanna, Kanye West, Jay-Z, Kelly Rowland\n- Songs: \"Man Down\", \"Who Gon Stop Me\", \"Boo Thang\"\n- Albums: Loud\n- Charts: Billboard\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Rihanna released the song \"Man Down\" on her fifth studio album, \"Loud\".\n- Verse Simmonds co-wrote and produced Rihanna's \"Man Down\", and the song charted prominently on Billboard.\n- Verse Simmonds co-wrote and produced \"Who Gon Stop Me\" by Kanye West and Jay-Z, and the song charted prominently on Billboard.\n- \"Boo Thang\" is a song by American rapper Verse Simmonds featuring guest vocals from Kelly Rowland.",
